<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Columbia/HCA restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Columbia/HCA restarted.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said Friday it restarted coverage of Columbia/HCA Healthcare Corp with intermediate-term neutral and long-term buy ratings.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst not available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 3/8 to 32-7/8.</p>
</text>
